{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17469","headline":"古乐府 · 权德舆","name":"古乐府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风光澹荡百花吐，楼上朝朝学歌舞。\n身年二八壻侍中，幼妹承恩兄尚主。\n绿窗珠箔绣鸳鸯，侍婢先焚百和香。\n莺啼日出不知曙，寂寂罗帏春梦长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}